      "impact_statement": "the advisory names x/crypto's openpgp packages (golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp and its subpackages), and the one package of the module the binaries link is golang.org/x/crypto/ocsp, which github.com/pdfcpu/pdfcpu/pkg/pdfcpu/sign imports and internal/extract reaches through pdfcpu. This is false as soon as any openpgp package is linked into a release binary, which the release gate checks on every run against go list -deps of each release target and fails on. With no fixed version, the declaration becomes unnecessary only when pdfcpu stops importing ocsp"
